# Openings (docs/DIALOGUE.md, "Who talks"; docs/DESIGN.md, "Openings"): whoever's outside the door you
# come out of. Nobody is new: everyone has been trapped since the seal, and they never say "you're new".
# The step's ask and the story's beats are the built lines (RZ_OpeningText); these add their greeting,
# once, while the first step runs, and a few things to ask on the way. Character flags: opening.first
# 1 while the first step runs; opening.why why today (1 the hiding place, 2 your group gone, 3 the fever
# broke); opening.who who's outside (1 someone from before, by your background; 2 a stranger; 3 a
# wanderer who met an earlier life of yours); opening.earlier what that wanderer remembers (1 a
# kindness, 2 a wrong, 3 only the face); opening.step the step under way (1-3; 4 once it's over);
# opening.end the faction it ends with (1 the Haven, 2 Bastion, 3 the Red Hand, 4 Halcyon).
# Voice: plain, a neighbour's.

conv opening.greet.stranger
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=2
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.why=2 :: "Your lot went out three mornings ago, four of them, with a map. I watched from my window. I've been watching it since."
  say? cflag:opening.why=3 :: "That was my chalk on your door. I heard you through it for three nights. Then I didn't, and I waited anyway."
  say "I heard the bolt go. Don't mind me. I don't know you, but nobody should come out of a door on their own."

conv opening.greet.earlier
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=3
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.earlier=2 :: "You look like someone I knew. Someone I'd cross the road from. Different face, though. Different chance."
  say? cflag:opening.earlier=1 :: "You look like someone I knew. They did me a kindness on the road, once. Funny. You stand the way they did."
  say "You look like someone I knew. Same walk. I don't suppose you'd remember a face from the road."

conv opening.greet.nurse
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:nurse
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.why=2 :: "It's you. I came back and the others didn't. My boy kept asking for the nurse who did his stitches. I said you'd be here."
  say? cflag:opening.why=3 :: "You did my boy's stitches in May, and I sat outside your door four nights. I wasn't leaving you to it."
  say "It's you. You did my boy's stitches in May. He still shows people the scar, when there's people to show."

conv opening.greet.doctor
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:doctor
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.why=2 :: "Doctor. They went for the clinic at the crossroads and I turned back halfway. I'm not proud of it. I'm here, though."
  say? cflag:opening.why=3 :: "I chalked the door, Doctor. Ward rule: if they talk sense on day four, they're through it. You talked sense."
  say "Doctor. I'd know that cough through a wall. Ward three's gone, you know. All of it. We're what's left of the rota."

conv opening.greet.mechanic
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:mechanic
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.why=2 :: "You're still here. They took my van to go and look, and the van's not back either. You'd have heard her coming."
  say? cflag:opening.why=3 :: "That cough's gone. Good. I sat out here with my toolbox, fixing nothing, just to have something in my hands."
  say "It's you. You fixed my van twice and charged me once. I always meant to pay the other one."

conv opening.greet.hunter
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:hunter
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.why=2 :: "They went off across my bottom field three mornings back, the four of them. I'd know their tracks. Nobody's walked them home."
  say? cflag:opening.why=3 :: "I wrote that on your door. Saw a fox come through a fever like that, once. Never a person, till now."
  say "Thought that was you. Nobody else walks that quiet. My top field's yours now, if anyone still wants fields."

conv opening.greet.police
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:police
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.why=2 :: "Officer. Your lot went out with a map and a whistle. I kept the shop door open for them. I'll keep it open a while yet."
  say? cflag:opening.why=3 :: "Officer. I locked you in. Sorry. It was the only key I had, and you'd have done the same on your beat."
  say "Officer. You bought one apple every morning and never ate it. I used to wonder about that. I still do."

conv opening.greet.excon
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:excon
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.why=2 :: "Four went out, three days back. I stayed. I've done enough time waiting on people who said back by dark."
  say? cflag:opening.why=3 :: "Wrote it on your door like a cell wall. Counted the mornings the same way. Some things you don't unlearn."
  say "Look at you. Out of one box and straight into another. Some of us have a gift for it."

conv opening.greet.labtech
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:labtech
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.why=2 :: "They took our notes to the lab to trade for a place. I said I'd mind you. I'm minding you."
  say? cflag:opening.why=3 :: "Day four, the fever broke and the bite closed over. I wrote it all down. Somebody at the lab will want those notes."
  say "You're alive. They read your name out at the lab gate, with the missing. They still want hands like yours."

conv opening.greet.radioham
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:radioham
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.why=2 :: "They took the good set and went looking for a higher roof. I've listened on the old one every night. Nothing on it."
  say? cflag:opening.why=3 :: "I chalked your door and sat out here with the wind-up, reading you the weather. Every night. You never answered, till now."
  say "I know that voice. Half past one, the night band. You always signed off with the weather."

conv opening.greet.unemployed
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:unemployed
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.why=2 :: "They went out to see about food and I stayed to see about you. Neither of us had anything better on."
  say? cflag:opening.why=3 :: "I sat outside four nights. Didn't have anywhere else to be. Never have, really."
  say "You're alive. Good. Don't worry about the money. Money's a joke now, and not a good one."

conv opening.greet.soldier
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:soldier
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.why=2 :: "Sarge. The others went to find the line, to see if it's still there. I stayed with you. Somebody had to hold here."
  say? cflag:opening.why=3 :: "Sarge. Bitten on the arm, and still you. I chalked it on the door like a sitrep. I didn't believe it either."
  say "Sarge? It's me. The line went and I never made it back to it. Looks like you didn't either."

conv opening.greet.raider
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:raider
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.why=2 :: "Your crew left you three days ago. I'd have left you too. I came back for my watch, and here you are."
  say? cflag:opening.why=3 :: "I wrote on your door. Don't look at me like that. If you'd turned, I wanted my watch back first."
  say "You. You took my watch in March. Keep it. I want something else from you, and it isn't what you think."

conv opening.greet.elder
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:elder
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.why=2 :: "They went to see about the next town. I stayed. Somebody ought to be here when the old ones open their doors."
  say? cflag:opening.why=3 :: "I sat with your door like I sat with my mother's. She didn't come through it. You did."
  say "It's you. The children kept asking if you'd gone. I kept saying no. I'm glad I wasn't lying to them."

conv opening.greet.drifter
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:drifter
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.why=2 :: "You were with that lot who went out with the map. I know you. Everyone knows you a bit. They're not back."
  say? cflag:opening.why=3 :: "Somebody had to write on your door. I've seen you at every pump and market from here to the line. Couldn't not."
  say "I know you. Everyone knows you a bit, don't they. Never mind from where. You're alive, that's the thing."

conv opening.who_else
for opening
when cflag:opening.step>=1 & cflag:opening.step<=3
topic "Ask who else made it."
prio world
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Fewer than you'd hope. More than you'd think. Most are behind doors, same as you were."
  say "The ones who went for the roads in the first week, I don't count them any more. It's easier."
  > @road "What happened on the roads?" -> road
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node road
  say "Concrete where the bridges were. Drones over the fields. A loudspeaker that knows your name before you've said it."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv opening.who_holds
for opening
when cflag:opening.step>=2 & cflag:opening.step<=3
topic "Ask who's in charge now."
prio world
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Depends where you stand. The soldiers count you. The red-hand lot charge you. The lab people want your blood, politely."
  say "And the safehouses feed you if you work. That's the whole government now. Pick one before one picks you."
  > @lab "The lab people?" -> lab
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node lab
  say "Halcyon. White coats in a school, in masks. They say there's a cure in the specials, if enough of them get cut open."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv opening.where_now
for opening
when cflag:opening.step=3
topic "Ask where they'll go now."
prio flavour
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.end=3 :: "Not where you're going. They'd have the coat off my back before I'd said hello. I'll find a door."
  say "Behind you, at a distance. I'm slower than I look, and I look slow. Don't wait for me."
  > @come "Come with me." -> come
  > @fine "Mind how you go." -> hub

node come
  say "I will. Just not at your pace. Go on. If I'm not there by dark, I found somewhere better."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv opening.why_hiding
for opening
when cflag:opening.why=1 & cflag:opening.step>=1 & cflag:opening.step<=3
topic "Ask how long it's been."
prio flavour
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Long enough that the calendar's mostly pencil. Long enough that I stopped knocking every day and started knocking every other."
  say "People came out of their doors in ones and twos all week. You're the last on this street, I think."
  > @others "Who else came out?" -> others
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node others
  say "The baker's girl. The man with the dogs, without the dogs. A few I didn't know. Everybody looks thinner than I remember."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv opening.why_group
for opening
when cflag:opening.why=2 & cflag:opening.step>=1 & cflag:opening.step<=3
topic "Ask where the others went."
prio flavour
once
voice plain

node start
  say "To see about the next town. Bread, somebody said. Somebody always says bread."
  say "There's three days of dark between back by dark and now. Count them if you want. I've stopped counting."
  > @look "Should we go and look?" -> look
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node look
  say "Not today, and not the two of us. If they're anywhere, someone at a safehouse will have their names. Ask there."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv opening.why_fever
for opening
when cflag:opening.why=3 & cflag:opening.step>=1 & cflag:opening.step<=3
topic "Ask what happened to you."
prio flavour
once
voice plain

node start
  say "You were bitten on the third day. Then the fever. Most don't come out of it, or they come out as something else."
  say "You came out as you. The lab people would want to know how. I wouldn't tell them yet."
  > @why "Why not tell them?" -> lab
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node lab
  say "Because they'd want more than your story. Let them earn it. Go and see them when you choose, not when they send for you."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv opening.earlier_who
for opening
when cflag:opening.who=3 & cflag:opening.step>=1 & cflag:opening.step<=3
topic "Ask who they think you are."
prio flavour
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.earlier=2 :: "Someone who did me wrong on the road. Took what I had and left me the walk. Different face. I'm choosing to think so."
  say? cflag:opening.earlier=1 :: "Someone who did me a kindness on the road and never stayed to be thanked. Different face. Same way of standing."
  say "Someone I passed on the road, before. Different face, same hands. I'm probably wrong."
  say "If I'm not, you owe me a story. If I am, you owe me nothing. Either way, sit a minute."
  > @maybe "Maybe I was." -> maybe
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node maybe
  say "Then welcome back. It's no better out here than it was. The roads still go nowhere you'd want."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub
